# formal/phase09m-optimisation/9m1/mlkem_core_w2_safety.sby
# Phase 9M item 1 (added after the plan, see test_plan_9m1.md Amendment A1): the 9c controller proof (E1, S1-S7 of mlkem_core_formal_top.sv) with the core at CODEC_W2 = 1 (-D W2); the load / store tasks are protocol stubs (stubs_9m1.sv, the 9c stubs under the new names). Induction, depth 12.

[options]
mode prove
depth 12

[engines]
smtbmc boolector

[script]
plugin -i slang
read_slang -D FORMAL -D W2 stubs_9c.sv stubs_9m1.sv mlkem_ram.sv mlkem_ctl_rom.sv mlkem_core.sv mlkem_core_formal_top.sv --top mlkem_core_formal_top
prep -top mlkem_core_formal_top
memory_map -rom-only

